-// Competition hub — SCAFFOLD (spec: src/specs/competition/index.spec.json, "stub": true).
+// Competition page, Overview tab (spec: src/specs/competition/index.spec.json).
 //
-// This ships the URL section 3 of docs/site_architecture.md already reserves for the competition
-// hub, with a real canonical, a real hreflang set and a locale-distinct title — all true facts
-// about a URL that exists — and NO content blocks. #47 owns the hub's real content and binds it to
-// competitions/{league_code}/{season}.json (site_architecture.md section 5).
+// One page per competition per locale, iterated from competition_index.json — the same served
+// set the competitions index lists, so a competition added to the registry gets its page with no
+// code change. The page's content comes from competitions/{league_code}/{season}.json; the
+// latest served season is the one shown, so after a season ends the final table and the season's
+// numbers stay until the next season's first data arrives. A competition with no payload yet
